{{!
    @template block_notices/notices_admin

    Renders the Manage notices admin list. Per notice the primary row
    (status badges, show/hide, title, content, timestamp) is always
    visible; details (owner, URL, attribution) and secondary action
    icons (move, exclusive, edit, delete) are hover-revealed on
    pointer-fine devices and always visible on touch devices.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * groups - array of visibility groups (In preview, Visible, Hidden),
      each with: groupcssclasssuffix, description, css (bootstrap badge
      colour), count, and a notices array. Each notice carries id, title,
      content, visible, staffonly, sortorder, timecreated, timemodified,
      hasimage, imageurl, isexclusive_important, isexclusive_information,
      ismodified, readcount, readcountcurrent, moreinformationurl, owner,
      owneremail, createdby, createdbylink, modifiedby, modifiedbylink,
      plus the per-action booleans (canshow, canhide, canmoveup,
      canmovedown, cansetexclusive_important, cansetexclusive_information,
      canclearexclusive, canpromote, candelete).
    * canmanageall - bool, whether the "Add notice" action is shown.
    * sesskey - string, session key for the action links.
    * courseid - int, course being managed.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "sesskey": "aBcDeF1234",
        "courseid": 2,
        "canmanageall": true,
        "groups": [
            {
                "groupcssclasssuffix": "visibility-preview",
                "description": "In preview",
                "css": "warning",
                "count": 1,
